">43-df-computable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Corollary 11.11.5 (Kjos-Hanssen–Merkle–Stephan), wtt characterization"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"276"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"296"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-round3"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OrderComplex}\">\\(\\operatorname{OrderComplex}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DNC}\">\\(\\operatorname{DNC}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^X,u_e^X\">\\(\\Phi_e^X,u_e^X\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Computable}\">\\(\\operatorname{Computable}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"bcb978a14a477f5c\" href=\"?note=bcb978a14a477f5c\" title=\"43-df-order-complexity\">43-df-order-complexity</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"323b0a74dc337ecf\" href=\"?note=323b0a74dc337ecf\" title=\"43-df-dnc\">43-df-dnc</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4400f4836786a4bd\" href=\"?note=4400f4836786a4bd\" title=\"43-df-oracle-computation\">43-df-oracle-computation</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a>。所量化 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(f,b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 均总定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OrderComplex}(X)\\iff\\exists f,b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{DNC}(f)\\land\\operatorname{Computable}(b)\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists Q\\subseteq b(x)\\;\\operatorname{Exec}(e,X,x,s,f(x),Q)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{OrderComplex}(X)\\iff\\exists f,b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{DNC}(f)\\land\\operatorname{Computable}(b)\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists Q\\subseteq b(x)\\;\\operatorname{Exec}(e,X,x,s,f(x),Q)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>函数f、b均总定义。运行见证直接给定输出f(x)和有限查询界；发散候选没有Exec见证，因此无需读取未定义的使用量。</p>\n<p>来源定位沿用附件：Corollary 11.11.5 (Kjos-Hanssen–Merkle–Stephan), wtt characterization。本轮核查形式化的内部一致性；未重新核对原书完整证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-order-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"bcb978a14a477f5c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-order-complexity]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-dnc","status":"resolved","id":"323b0a74dc337ecf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-dnc]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-oracle-computation","status":"resolved","id":"4400f4836786a4bd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-oracle-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-order-complexity","status":"resolve